{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set sail on an epic adventure across the Caribbean Sea in the 18th century.</strong><br><i>Storm Seas</i> is an open-world maritime trading simulator where you take command of your own ship to build a fortune or lose everything to storms, pirates, or poor choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore exotic islands, buy and sell goods, upgrade your ships, hire your crew, and survive in a dynamic world full of danger. But this isn\u2019t just about trading you must also eat, drink, and rest to stay alive, and always be ready for unexpected naval encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also purchase land in cities to grow crops and craft your own resources, allowing you to reduce market dependency and increase your profits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2693 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf34 <strong>Open-world Caribbean</strong> setting in the 18th century.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905530/extras/bbeb1fdeb253ab64709a692ae6101a80.avif?t=1774397500\" width=1566 height=874 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Dynamic trading system</strong>: buy low, sell high\u2026 if you make it back alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26f5 <strong>Wide variety of ships</strong>: buy new vessels and upgrade them for better cargo capacity or combat capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Land ownership and production</strong>: grow your own resources and build your supply chain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf57 <strong>Survival elements</strong>: manage food, water, and rest for yourself and your crew.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905530/extras/4d8b55c6f58ce0bb1f1608664a11d37c.avif?t=1774397500\" width=1566 height=872 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf29\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic weather and random events</strong> that can change the course of your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Optional naval combat</strong>: avoid or engage enemies depending on your readiness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905530/extras/d11335c97c82e1db8818bcce1590730e.avif?t=1774397500\" width=1568 height=874 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Exploration and discovery</strong>: every island and port holds secrets, opportunities, and challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an immersive experience where your choices and skills will determine whether you become a legendary trader\u2026 or shark bait.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905530?t=1774397500","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905530?t=1774397500","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905530/74da8964c025641b3c3b794b63e01d40f4a374fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774397500","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905530/74da8964c025641b3c3b794b63e01d40f4a374fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774397500","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p c